    "title": "Rounds of showers, storms expected mid-week in Carolinas - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rachel Coulter ,\n1 days ago CHARLOTTE, N.C. (WBTV) - Rain chances are about to pick up for the middle of the work week. Wednesday will start with areas of light rain and warm temperatures in the 60s. By the afternoon hours, we’ll top out in the 80s once again before another round of scattered showers and storms moves in for the evening. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
